  "details": "VRChat Version:\nBuild 1230 (w_2022.2.2p4-92ecc54aca)\nDescription of the bug:\nI was playing for around 1.5 hours perfectly normally, and then I randomly got an error saying I had been disconnected from VRChat servers due to an Anti-Cheat Error. I have never installed mods of any form.\nSteps to reproduce (how did you encounter the bug?):\nThis happened during a game of Fate of the Irrbloss, and I had been alone in the world the whole time. The error occurred very shortly after a friend joined me in the world, and the friend was in a new avatar. Perhaps the avatar being downloaded and saved to cache caused some EAC issue.\nAny extra files? (output logs, screenshots):\nNo screenshots. I do have a log file but I don't know how to attach it here.",
